ctory/woodtapper/pull/27\r\n* Update doc with warning doe windows users by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/28\r\n* Update paper/paper.md for new JOSS requirements by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/29\r\n* Add State of field for JOSS pre-review by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/30\r\n* FIX reproductibility of python experiments in the paper by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/32\r\n* Reformat examples to match PEP8 by @jncraton in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/31\r\n* Add compatibility of notebooks experiments with google colab by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/33\r\n* fix(paper joss): add summary section at the begining of the paper aft… by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/34\r\n* Add reproductibility for timing simulations by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/36\r\n* Joss manuscript review by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/39\r\n* Joss paper rev by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/40\r\n* fix(refs): add missings dois for gbdt and shap by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/41\r\n* fix(refs):doi from sklearn by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/42\r\n* Joss vernon review by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/43\r\n* Joss by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/44\r\n* Readme citation accepted paper by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/45\r\n* Fix ample exp by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/46\r\n* Fix explanation by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/47\r\n* feat: add features names options for example samples by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/48\r\n* feat: verbosity attribute for rules extractors (false by default) by @Abdoulaye-SAKHO in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/49\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jncraton made their first contribution in https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/pull/31\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/compare/v0.0.13...0.0.14","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artefactory/woodtapper/releases/371615150/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":2},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artefactory/woodtapper/releases/264726375","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artefactory/woodtapper/releases/264726375/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/artefactory/woodtapper/releases/264726375/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper/releases/tag/v0.0.13","id":264726375,"author":{"login":"Abdoulaye-SAKHO","id":130471399,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8bV5w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130471399?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO","html_url":"https://github.com/Abdoulaye-SAKHO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/received_events","type":"User","user